No! No!

827
01:16:34.904 --> 01:16:37.305
"Susie Willis killed.
Trapped in car.

828
01:16:37.373 --> 01:16:40.142
"Driver unharmed.
Survived by her father, Benjamin,

829
01:16:40.210 --> 01:16:42.277
a local fisherman."

