860
01:23:19.625 --> 01:23:25.363
It was someone else
on the road that night.
What are you talking about?

861
01:23:25.431 --> 01:23:27.765
- But they found David's body
in the water.Susie's father,
- yeah, I know.'S a fishermabena

862
