- but I think Ben Willis killed David Egan.
- Wait a second.

863
01:23:31.036 --> 01:23:34.005
You think Willis killed David,
then we killed him?

864
01:23:34.073 --> 01:23:37.008
What if he didn't die, Ray?
What if he's still alive?

865
01:23:38.478 --> 01:23:40.945
