866
01:23:42.115 --> 01:23:44.416
Come aboard. Come inside.

867
01:23:44.484 --> 01:23:49.020
No, we've gotta find Helen and Barry.
We will. We will.

868
01:24:01.700 --> 01:24:03.835
You.

869
