she looks so fine ♪

931
01:37:19.063 --> 01:37:21.298
♪ she's the best girl
that I ever had ♪

932
01:37:21.366 --> 01:37:21.799
♪ except that's the girl
that made me feel so sad ♪

933
01:37:21.867 --> 01:37:23.434
Ade me feel so sad ♪

934
01:37:30.842 --> 01:37:35.112
♪ Whoa

935
01:37:39.418 --> 01:37:43.621
♪ Hey, now hush, hush thought I
